# SHIPPED, not operator state: `make pi-ship` overwrites it.
#
# Where a house flow that uses Encrypted Client Hello may go under the SNI
# check (HOUSE_BLOCK_DIRECT_IP=on). ECH hides the name of the site behind
# the public name of the provider. Thus the address of the flow cannot be
# matched to the name. The resolver of the device already filtered the
# real name. The flow can go only into the published ranges of the provider.
# Cloudflare, https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4 (2026-09-23).
